This is where an AI application becomes more than a chatbot.

A model can request that your backend execute a function.

For example:

- Analyse an image.
- Retrieve material information.
- Get project settings.
- Generate a visualization.
- Save a generation.
- Compare two images.

This is generally called tool calling or function calling.

